<title>EGYPT: Egypt and Kyrgyzstan sign protocol accord.</title>
<headline>Egypt and Kyrgyzstan sign protocol accord.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt and Kyrgyzstan signed a protocol accord on Wednesday to strengthen bilateral ties.</p>
<p>Foreign Minister Amr Moussa, who signed the accord with Kyrgyz Foreign Minister Roza Otunbayeva in Cairo, said their meeting was an opportunity to discuss economic and other ties.</p>
</text>
